        "CvId": 152101,
        "Cvs": 1,
        "Timing": 68435.0,
        "Text": "They're sincere and fervent... yet insufficient, to express all that I feel for you."
    },
    {
        "Id": 152101112,
        "CvId": 152101,
        "Cvs": 1,
        "Timing": 76886.0,
        "Text": "If you will... allow me to be a bit more selfish\u2014"
    },
    {
        "Id": 152101113,
        "CvId": 152101,
        "Cvs": 1,
        "Timing": 81282.0,
        "Text": "I want to give you this ring, as a testament to my vow:"
    },
    {
        "Id": 152101114,
        "CvId": 152101,
        "Cvs": 1,
        "Timing": 88665.0,
        "Text": "Whatever the future may hold, until the end of time... or even life itself, I will never part from you."
